Subject: [PATCH 2/5] SCH-103: Verify offline queue replay and cancellation
 release

Run all nine queued-admission PostgreSQL regressions with the race detector on PostgreSQL 18.6 and pgvector 0.8.7 inside a loopback-only network namespace. Verify real committed dequeue acknowledgement loss, current shares after a lock wait, replay, scope refusal, cancellation and rollback.

Add the persisted cancelling-to-cancelled transition beside exact release and prove a late audit failure restores both owner state and hold. Clarify the initial fair candidate selector and complete eligible reader required from training. Keep production owner integration and full repository gates open.
